 <section class="rk-section rk-section--tint" id="jvg-s-44-related-guides"><div class="rk-wrap"><h2>Get Help With Your Rickenbacker</h2><p>Send photos of the front, back, both sides of the headstock, serial plate, pickups, bridge and controls. Include any known repairs or replacement parts. I can help identify the instrument and discuss its value. For the next step, read <a href="/rickenbacker-finish-colors/#finish-originality">how to check the finish</a> and learn <a href="/post/is-your-vintage-guitar-valuable-7-factors-that-determine-its-value/">which factors affect vintage guitar value</a>.</p><p><a class="rk-button" href="/free-appraisal/rickenbacker/">Get A Free Rickenbacker Appraisal</a></p><p>Ready to sell? Read about <a href="/sell-my-rickenbacker-guitar/">selling your Rickenbacker to Joe</a>.</p><nav class="rk-toc" aria-label="Related serial guides"><a href="/fender-guitars-serial-number-guide/">Fender Serial Numbers</a><a href="/how-to-read-gibson-serial-numbers/">Gibson Serial Numbers</a><a href="/martin-serial-and-model-numbers/">Martin Serial Numbers</a><a href="/gretsch-serial-number-lookup/">Gretsch Serial Numbers</a><a href="/guild-serial-number-lookup/">Guild Serial Numbers</a><a href="/vintage-fender-amplifier-serial-numbers-how-to-find-the-year/">Fender Amplifier Dating</a><a href="/post/is-your-vintage-guitar-valuable-7-factors-that-determine-its-value/">Guitar Value Factors</a><a href="/post/blue-book-of-guitar-values-and-vintage-guitar-price-guide/">Guitar Price Guides</a></nav></div></section>
